<title>SPAIN: Spain's car sales up 2.24 pct in March - Anfac.</title>
<headline>Spain's car sales up 2.24 pct in March - Anfac.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish car sales in March totalled 98,243 units, a rise of 2.24 percent on the same month in 1996, provisional data from Spanish carmakers' association Anfac showed.</p>
<p>In the first quarter, total car sales reached 239,673 units, 6.41 percent higher than the year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
